{"version":1,"content":"<p>影帝張家輝雖然憑《証人》與《激戰》奠定實力派演技地位，但他內心的「歌手魂」始終未曾熄滅！</p><p>據知，家輝已落實將於來年農曆新年（2月）期間正式進軍紅館開騷，正式宣告重回樂壇，一圓多年來的歌手夢，據悉，相關大型宣傳預計於11月全面啟動。</p><p>家輝經理人公</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:13.582717+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T02:11:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.794455+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"06a221bab690c55778d7644aefd9ce84843e6dcccead4f832eafb1d1f1671272","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}